    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d245">

                <pb facs="0343" n="231" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg231"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/5952: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of the Technical Board</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Stevens</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Harbin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-12-23T22:00:00+08:26"><hi rendition="#italic">December 23,
                                1919, 10 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received December 23, 9
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Capture Tomsk and 6,000 soldiers with a general by the anti-Kolchak forces officially confirmed. Nothing
                    evacuated from the city. Rumor not yet confirmed capture of Taiga with some
                    American Red Cross people cut off.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Stevens</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
